  "body": "## What changed\n\n`assets/machines/doosan-dnm.mch` now states its travel per the travel rule in `assets/machines/AGENTS.md` (#457): the full catalog stroke either way, read in program coordinates through the work offset.\n\n| Axis | Was | Now |\n|---|---|---|\n| X | `-510..510` | `-1020..1020` |\n| Y | `-285..285` | `-570..570` |\n| Z | `-510..0` (machine frame) | `-510..510` |\n\nBefore, every move above G54's Z0 was refused at the post.\n\n## Pinning tests (`crates/app/tests/vmc_stroke.rs`)\n\n- `a_plate_contour_on_the_built_in_dnm_passes_the_stroke`: checks the three bands, that `check_document` is clean, and that the gate has no stroke problem.\n- `a_clearance_past_the_dnm_column_still_refuses_by_name`: a clearance of Z 520 is refused with `the stroke is -510.000..510.000` and does not post.\n- Mutation check: restoring main's `doosan-dnm.mch` turns both red.\n\n## Not exercised / follow-up\n\nThe issue's face job still does not post end to end, for a different reason. The DNM's optional A states no `nose_to_axis`, so the index-swing law refuses every program on it, even at A0. I did not invent a figure for it. That is filed as **#1433** (P3; workaround: state the setup's `nose_to_axis`), and the first pin asserts it is the only refusal left.\n\nNo Hub run: the Hub simulates Tormach machines only, and this is a machine-file change pinned headlessly.\n\n## Gates\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green. It ran the post suites `doosan_dnm_post` and `probe_spindle_stop`, and the app suites `conformance`, `doosan_dnm_a_state`, `post_*`, `probe_no_coolant`, `program_units` and `vmc_stroke`.\n- Also green: `machine`, `fourth_axis_pose` and `coolant_air`.\n\nEffort: medium (as labelled; no escalation).\nFork synced at v0.18.0; branch is cut from upstream/main.\nDecision: `docs/decisions/1410-dnm-travel.md`.\n\nChangelog: The built-in Doosan DNM 5700 states its X/Y/Z travel as full strokes each way, so moves above the work origin are no longer refused as over-travel.\n\nFixes #1410\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
